---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT r FROM (SELECT a, b, rank() OVER (ORDER BY c) AS r, sum(c) OVER () AS s FROM t)"
---
Project [_we0#5 AS r#3]
+- Window [rank() OVER (ORDER BY c#2 ASC NULLS FIRST ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) AS _we0#5], [], [c#2 ASC NULLS FIRST]
   +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [c#2]
